  "body": "A number of 'stream' tables are appended-to, but are never cleared out. Such tables include:\r\n* cache_invalidation_stream_by_instance (fixed by https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/pull/15868)\r\n* current_state_delta_stream\r\n* ~~presence_stream~~ (does get cleaned out; has been ever since its creation in #582)\r\n* ~~device_inbox~~ (not really a 'stream' table actually, so a separate problem)\r\n* device_federation_outbox\r\n* ~~local_group_updates~~ (removed in #12967)\r\n* push_rules_stream\r\n* ex_outlier_stream\r\n* ~public_room_list_stream~ (now removed)",
